Hi,

Thanks to Shane Lin for asking about where to register for the annual
annual joint PWG / Open Printing Summit.  Registration is FREE (no
conference fees at all).

Agenda details and a registration survey will be posted (in April) at:

http://www.pwg.org/chair/meeting-info/meetings.html

Cheers,
- Ira (Open Printing chair)

